<title>USA: Figgie CEO/president resigns.</title>
<headline>Figgie CEO/president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WILLOUGHBY, Ohio 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figgie International Inc said Friday that Chairman John Reilly has resigned as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>It said Reilly would become chief executive and president of Stant Corp and would serve as non-employee chairman of Figgie.</p>
<p>Figgie said it has created a new Office of the Chairman, consisting of Reilly, Chief Financial Officer Steven Siemborski, and Glen Lindemann, president of the company's Scott Aviation division.</p>
<p>The new office was created while the company searches for a new chief executive, it said.</p>
</text>
